at email, so password-based authentication is broken in both directions.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the create-listing form fully empty kept native browser required-field validation blocking submission (title/description/price marked required). Submitting with title, description, price filled but no category/condition selected showed toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\" and did not create a listing. Submitting with title, description, price, category, condition, location filled but no photo attached showed toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\" and did not create a listing (still on /create-listing).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is a native number input with min=\\\"0\\\"; entering -5 and submitting triggered native validation \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\" and blocked submission (no listing created, stayed on /create-listing). Entering non-numeric text \\\"abc\\\" was rejected by the number input itself (value reverts to empty), which combined with the required attribute blocks submission via \\\"Please fill out this field.\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No duplicate-account feedback shown\", \"actual\": \"Attempting to register with an already-used email (exact and case-variant) did not produce any duplicate-account error; instead the app silently created a new account and navigated away from the registration form to the home page with a success toast.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
